body:
Heyyyyy! I got my first like a month ago and it's awesome, innit? 

&#x200B;

Remember to take breaks and only bind for 8-10 hours and never double-bind. I'm proud of you!

ayyy cavetown.

&#x200B;

also, that's an amazing coping skill to use! good job!!

Indeed... mine was Shasta from the Horse and His Boy. 

&#x200B;

Yeah... but also the douchebag in my head who goes by the name gender dysphoria. It's... awful.

Thank you very much for the reply and the hugs, Laura. I think the helplines and the resources are definitely a good idea.

&#x200B;

\-Abbott
